The pet's likeness
------------------

The character "Jokbet" is drawn in the pixel style of Clawd, the mascot of
Anthropic's Claude Code, and two of its animations (the soccer loop and the
typing loop) are derived from screen recordings of that mascot. None of that
material — the character design, the sprite art in src/sprites/, or the
animations built from it — is covered by the MIT License, which the copyright
holder has no authority to grant for it.

The same applies to the icon set, the poster, the pixel wordmark and the
favicons under site/assets/ and src-tauri/icons/, which are generated from that
sprite art.

Jokbet is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
sponsored by, or approved by Anthropic. Do not present it, or a work derived
from it, as an official Anthropic product, and do not use Anthropic's marks to
promote it.


Reference recordings
--------------------

The two recordings the animations were decoded from are not distributed with
this repository, and are excluded by .gitignore. tools/extract-reference-frames
documents how they were used, for anyone who wants to repeat or extend the work
with material of their own.


